<title>ARGENTINA: RUGBY UNION-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT ARGENTINA'S ROSARIO 45-36.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT ARGENTINA'S ROSARIO 45-36.</headline>
<dateline>ROSARIO, Argentina 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat</p>
<p>Rosario 45-36 (half time 33-10) in the first match of their</p>
<p>tour of Argentina on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Result: Rosario 36, South Africa 45</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Rosario: Tries-Raul Perez, Rodrigo Crexell, Gonzalo Acuna,</p>
<p>Diego Flook, Carlos Promancio. Conversions-Crexell (4).</p>
<p>Penalty-Crexell.</p>
<p>South Africa: Tries-Toks van der Linde, Dick Muir (2),</p>
<p>Schutte Bekker, Andre Snyman, Wayne Fyvie, Justin Swart.</p>
<p>Conversions-Franco Smith (5).</p>
</text>
